     WHERE mcq_id = (SELECT id FROM component_mcq WHERE question = 'It is 11pm. You had a difficult conversation with someone close to you earlier this evening. You are still upset. You are alone. Your AI chat window is open on your laptop, and you are considering typing everything out and asking it to help you make sense of what happened. What do you do?') 
